WEBVTT

﻿1
00:01:16.410 --> 00:01:17.953
This will make you happy.

2
00:01:18.537 --> 00:01:19.914
I will get money

3
00:01:19.997 --> 00:01:22.374
Just half of what I got.

4
00:01:25.169 --> 00:01:27.338
I said I would play.
If it's twice as much as me, remember?

5
00:01:37.973 --> 00:01:38.808
Let's go.

6
00:01:43.395 --> 00:01:44.688
Hello

7
00:01:44.772 --> 00:01:48.150
I'm Kwonzena and I'm joining.
Acting in "The Good Detective Kang Pilgu"

8
00:01:48.234 --> 00:01:49.109
Whoa!

9
00:01:53.405 --> 00:01:55.991
(Search)

10
00:01:58.702 --> 00:02:00.913
Regarding that video I sent you…

11
00:02:00.996 --> 00:02:03.916
There is another person who is not in the video.

12
00:02:03.999 --> 00:02:05.960
Who is very famous?

13
00:02:06.669 --> 00:02:07.920
Quanzena

14
00:02:11.590 --> 00:02:15.219
I'm too afraid to keep this to myself.

15
00:02:21.517 --> 00:02:24.812
{\an8}(Is there a third party involved?)

16
00:02:43.330 --> 00:02:44.582
{\an8}(New Special Studio)

17
00:02:44.665 --> 00:02:46.375
{\an8}Is something wrong with you?

18
00:02:46.458 --> 00:02:48.252
{\an8}What's wrong? Can't breathe anymore?

19
00:02:48.836 --> 00:02:51.046
{\an8}- Try to breathe out.
- It's not that matter.

20
00:02:51.130 --> 00:02:52.131
{\an8}Breathe! Hurry!

21
00:02:52.214 --> 00:02:53.883
{\an8}Say it's not that story!

22
00:02:53.966 --> 00:02:55.885
{\an8}It's not that I can't breathe.

23
00:02:56.468 --> 00:03:00.931
{\an8}I'm too upset to breathe!

24
00:03:02.516 --> 00:03:05.895
{\an8}I just found out about Zena myself.

25
00:03:06.854 --> 00:03:07.855
{\an8}You really don't know, do you?

26
00:03:07.938 --> 00:03:09.481
{\an8}I swear, I don't know!

27
00:03:09.565 --> 00:03:13.694
{\an8}- Why must I risk lying to you?
- How can you not know?

28
00:03:13.777 --> 00:03:16.030
I guess since we rejected the movie

29
00:03:16.113 --> 00:03:18.073
So they kept it a secret. So it won't crash again.

30
00:03:18.157 --> 00:03:19.950
Stop lying!

31
00:03:20.034 --> 00:03:21.994
OK, listen to me.

32
00:03:22.077 --> 00:03:24.079
(Kingsback Entertainment)

33
00:03:34.006 --> 00:03:34.924
How can I do it?

34
00:03:37.009 --> 00:03:38.844
But I'm shooting a movie...

35
00:03:40.137 --> 00:03:41.597
Not with Ms. Quanzena.

36
00:03:42.806 --> 00:03:44.391
I like Mr. Im Hyun Joon.

37
00:03:50.439 --> 00:03:52.191
You know that we used to be together, right?

38
00:03:54.318 --> 00:03:55.611
Don't you know?

39
00:03:55.694 --> 00:03:56.862
Am I the only one who doesn't know?

40
00:03:57.404 --> 00:04:00.240
I acted really bad to him when we broke up.

41
00:04:00.324 --> 00:04:01.867
Hyun Jun hyung was very angry at me.

42
00:04:01.951 --> 00:04:04.662
I want to use this work as an opportunity to reconcile with him.

43
00:04:05.663 --> 00:04:06.914
You guys will help me, right?

44
00:04:21.136 --> 00:04:23.931
In this story, Joo Ri and Han Seok meet through a dating app.

45
00:04:24.014 --> 00:04:26.558
Have you guys ever used an app like that before?

46
00:04:27.893 --> 00:04:30.646
Do women really meet men through dating apps?

47
00:04:30.729 --> 00:04:32.231
Isn't that what losers do?

48
00:04:33.899 --> 00:04:35.359
I'm ****** so tired.

49
00:04:36.235 --> 00:04:37.945
The team leader sent it to me.

50
00:04:46.912 --> 00:04:48.330
I'm sorry, Mr. Reporter.

51
00:04:48.914 --> 00:04:50.791
I'm still hungover.

52
00:04:50.874 --> 00:04:52.334
Don't be mad at me!

53
00:05:02.594 --> 00:05:03.595
******Really tired

54
00:05:07.683 --> 00:05:08.892
Actor, I'm really sorry.

55
00:05:08.976 --> 00:05:10.936
I worked late last night and didn't sleep at all.

56
00:05:11.020 --> 00:05:13.022
I'm really sorry.

57
00:05:13.105 --> 00:05:14.189
Don't be angry at me!

58
00:05:16.066 --> 00:05:17.067
But...

59
00:05:17.151 --> 00:05:19.945
- Can I have some of that?
- What do you say?

60
00:05:20.029 --> 00:05:21.572
Interviews are boring.

61
00:05:22.156 --> 00:05:24.074
Until I needed that shit to wake up.

62
00:05:28.328 --> 00:05:30.039
I'm really sorry!

63
00:05:31.206 --> 00:05:32.458
Team leader, hand me my cell phone.

64
00:05:40.466 --> 00:05:41.508
So glad I was able to vent.

65
00:05:44.094 --> 00:05:44.970
Do you want to reconcile?

66
00:05:45.554 --> 00:05:46.638
It's you and me.

67
00:05:47.681 --> 00:05:50.225
What made you want to act in this drama?

68
00:05:50.309 --> 00:05:51.894
I know that you will never stop being Kang Pilgu.

69
00:05:51.977 --> 00:05:52.936
And what about that movie?

70
00:05:53.020 --> 00:05:55.564
I refused after you refused.

71
00:05:56.648 --> 00:05:58.358
So, Yahoo!

72
00:05:58.442 --> 00:06:01.070
Then I'll stop being Kang Pilgu.
and went to act in that movie instead

73
00:06:01.153 --> 00:06:02.905
Then I will act in that movie too.

74
00:06:05.032 --> 00:06:06.283
What are you thinking of doing?

75
00:06:06.867 --> 00:06:08.035
I told you so.

76
00:06:08.118 --> 00:06:10.788
I still have feelings for you. and want to reconcile

77
00:06:13.248 --> 00:06:14.666
Quonzena, stop fooling around.

78
00:06:14.750 --> 00:06:17.836
How can we work on the same project?

79
00:06:18.712 --> 00:06:20.589
We can't work on the same project.

80
00:06:21.173 --> 00:06:23.092
I really had to get this role.

81
00:06:24.051 --> 00:06:26.470
Do you want me to completely disappear from this world?

82
00:06:29.056 --> 00:06:30.432
Yes

83
00:06:30.516 --> 00:06:31.892
If you're gone, I'll thank you.

84
00:06:33.018 --> 00:06:34.186
Did I act really bad then?

85
00:06:34.269 --> 00:06:35.562
I was too young to know.

86
00:06:35.646 --> 00:06:36.730
No need to claim.

87
00:06:37.731 --> 00:06:40.192
I was young then
And I wanted to play that role with all my heart.

88
00:06:41.985 --> 00:06:45.948
I don't want to apologize or ask you to forgive me.

89
00:06:46.031 --> 00:06:48.492
I gave up on such pitiful excuses a long time ago.

90
00:06:48.575 --> 00:06:49.827
I couldn't even speak.

91
00:06:50.619 --> 00:06:53.080
Can you think of it like this instead?

92
00:06:54.081 --> 00:06:55.791
Pretend we just met today for the first time.

93
00:06:56.667 --> 00:06:58.544
It's like we're starting over.

94
00:07:01.130 --> 00:07:02.881
Do I look like I have amnesia?

95
00:07:14.768 --> 00:07:16.019
Have you just come to work?

96
00:07:17.646 --> 00:07:19.273
Just came back from an interview.

97
00:07:20.232 --> 00:07:22.067
How's the work?

98
00:07:23.527 --> 00:07:25.112
I'm trying to adapt.

99
00:07:26.697 --> 00:07:30.117
I heard that you will be covering tomorrow's baseball game.

100
00:07:30.200 --> 00:07:31.451
It means throwing the ball to open the field.

101
00:07:31.535 --> 00:07:33.495
Oh, yes.

102
00:07:33.996 --> 00:07:34.997
Shall we go together?

103
00:07:36.456 --> 00:07:37.541
What do you say?

104
00:07:37.624 --> 00:07:38.792
I'm sorry.

105
00:07:39.501 --> 00:07:41.211
Sounds like it's too flirty?

106
00:07:41.295 --> 00:07:42.337
Not at all.

107
00:07:43.338 --> 00:07:44.506
I never said that.

108
00:07:44.590 --> 00:07:46.550
It's too bad because I meant to sound like I was flirting.

109
00:07:53.473 --> 00:07:54.474
What are you doing?

110
00:07:54.558 --> 00:07:56.602
I want to be like you said.

111
00:07:56.685 --> 00:08:00.731
People who decide to be good people No matter what

112
00:08:02.357 --> 00:08:04.818
President, you are a very good person.

113
00:08:04.902 --> 00:08:07.654
It's like you've already made up your mind.
That you'll always be nice to me

114
00:08:07.738 --> 00:08:09.031
No matter what

115
00:08:11.992 --> 00:08:14.953
Looking back
I really like what you said.

116
00:08:15.913 --> 00:08:19.208
So I really want to try to be that kind of person.

117
00:08:22.377 --> 00:08:25.631
If we bump into each other tomorrow at the baseball field

118
00:08:26.632 --> 00:08:29.134
It's probably not good at all.

119
00:08:29.885 --> 00:08:31.136
Yes, that's true.

120
00:08:38.685 --> 00:08:40.145
- Will you please give me a call?
- Yes.

121
00:08:41.355 --> 00:08:44.358
- Well, I'll see you tomorrow.
- Okay.

122
00:08:48.612 --> 00:08:50.530
- You're late.
- Traffic is stuck.

123
00:08:50.614 --> 00:08:52.366
What did you talk to the president about?

124
00:08:52.449 --> 00:08:53.659
He told her he'd see him tomorrow.

125
00:08:55.035 --> 00:08:57.371
Do I have to answer as well?

126
00:08:57.454 --> 00:08:59.289
Isn't that the point of the question?

127
00:09:00.374 --> 00:09:02.125
We just…

128
00:09:02.709 --> 00:09:04.294
We talked about personal matters a little.

129
00:09:18.433 --> 00:09:19.810
I went to ask this person...

130
00:09:21.687 --> 00:09:23.188
and knew that Zena had rejected many movies

131
00:09:23.272 --> 00:09:26.984
and agreed to reduce the price a lot
To act in "Kang Pilgu"

132
00:09:27.067 --> 00:09:30.237
Everyone said that she must really want to get back together with me.

133
00:09:30.320 --> 00:09:33.615
Since there was no other reason for her to take on this supporting role.

134
00:09:33.699 --> 00:09:36.159
- She said she still has feelings for me.
- What do you say?

135
00:09:36.243 --> 00:09:38.870
- She wants to start again.
- Really asking.

136
00:09:38.954 --> 00:09:41.290
Looks like she's showing up.
In every project I do

137
00:09:41.373 --> 00:09:42.916
And what will the senior do?

138
00:09:45.043 --> 00:09:47.587
This isn't the time to talk about that.

139
00:09:47.671 --> 00:09:49.464
For now, forget about Quonzena.

140
00:09:49.548 --> 00:09:51.258
We agreed that we would not meet again.

141
00:09:51.341 --> 00:09:53.677
As a director and actor, right?

142
00:09:58.640 --> 00:10:01.768
I know what the seniors are worried about.

143
00:10:01.852 --> 00:10:04.813
But now what? It's not the same anymore.
I don't have much to say anymore.

144
00:10:04.896 --> 00:10:08.942
And the senior said he didn't want to play.
Because of Ms. Quanzena Not because of me

145
00:10:09.026 --> 00:10:10.652
It's good that you mentioned this.

146
00:10:10.736 --> 00:10:14.656
Then pour out Mr. Quoncena.
Before you come and pull me, director.

147
00:10:14.740 --> 00:10:17.367
Why do I have to dump a world-class star like you?

148
00:10:17.993 --> 00:10:18.910
So how about this?

149
00:10:19.953 --> 00:10:23.248
In the beginning, I chased suspects in my car.

150
00:10:23.332 --> 00:10:25.042
Then there was a big accident.

151
00:10:25.125 --> 00:10:28.378
So I had surgery to change my face.
and came out as a completely different person

152
00:10:28.462 --> 00:10:31.214
This way, another actor can take on the role of Kang Pil Goo instead of me.

153
00:10:31.298 --> 00:10:32.341
Senior

154
00:10:33.258 --> 00:10:35.677
I will only cover that scene.
For the sake of old friendship

155
00:10:38.347 --> 00:10:40.432
Sorry for interrupting.

156
00:10:42.184 --> 00:10:45.479
But now it's time to play.

157
00:10:47.564 --> 00:10:50.233
I, Im Hyun Joon, vow to play.

158
00:10:50.317 --> 00:10:51.651
- Kang Pilgu season five
- You bastard!

159
00:10:51.735 --> 00:10:53.320
No matter what!

160
00:11:06.583 --> 00:11:09.294
“Right now I think it's the best.
That is, you keep doing what you're doing.

161
00:11:09.378 --> 00:11:12.923
Instead of trying new things."
The card says so.

162
00:11:13.006 --> 00:11:14.883
Pretend we just met today for the first time.

163
00:11:14.966 --> 00:11:15.967
It's like we're starting over.

164
00:11:16.051 --> 00:11:20.931
I, Im Hyun Joon, vow to play Kang Pil Goo season five.

165
00:11:21.014 --> 00:11:21.932
No matter what!

166
00:11:43.662 --> 00:11:45.372
What?

167
00:11:46.498 --> 00:11:50.794
Why does my mind think about that for no reason?

168
00:11:50.877 --> 00:11:54.381
You think I'm a kid there?

169
00:12:05.225 --> 00:12:06.685
I owe you an apology.

170
00:12:08.019 --> 00:12:09.980
It's really troubling me.

171
00:12:12.065 --> 00:12:13.608
Brother, what's wrong with you?

172
00:12:17.654 --> 00:12:18.947
- CEO Hwang
- What do you say?

173
00:12:19.573 --> 00:12:21.283
Can you apologize to someone in my place?

174
00:12:21.366 --> 00:12:23.285
Apologizing and taking care of those around you must be done yourself.

175
00:12:31.918 --> 00:12:35.422
I bet this season is going to be a hit.
If Quanzena plays too

176
00:12:38.175 --> 00:12:40.469
- You don't have to tell me.
- CEO Hwang

177
00:12:41.344 --> 00:12:43.013
I'm serious.

178
00:12:43.096 --> 00:12:45.307
If you tell me to play Kang Pilgu one more time

179
00:12:45.390 --> 00:12:46.892
I will move to another agency.

180
00:12:48.518 --> 00:12:50.854
This is the last time And I'm telling the truth

181
00:12:52.105 --> 00:12:53.273
Wait, are you going to play?

182
00:12:54.941 --> 00:12:57.194
-Are you really going to play?
- Yeah.

183
00:12:57.277 --> 00:12:59.362
I'm definitely okay with working with Quoncena.

184
00:12:59.446 --> 00:13:00.697
It's not okay anymore.

185
00:13:01.281 --> 00:13:02.908
But it'll be okay now.

186
00:13:02.991 --> 00:13:04.659
Because I'm a better person than Quoncena.

187
00:13:04.743 --> 00:13:06.328
You were right, bro!

188
00:13:06.411 --> 00:13:08.747
I don't care if you still have feelings for me.

189
00:13:09.331 --> 00:13:10.415
I will focus on my work.

190
00:13:10.499 --> 00:13:12.959
- This kind of concept really appeals to me.
- Not a concept

191
00:13:15.837 --> 00:13:17.506
I'll say it.

192
00:13:18.089 --> 00:13:19.758
I have a few conditions.

193
00:13:19.841 --> 00:13:21.218
Conditions?

194
00:13:21.301 --> 00:13:22.594
- First point
- First point

195
00:13:23.178 --> 00:13:26.640
There must be no love story with Quoncena.

196
00:13:26.723 --> 00:13:28.391
No matter what, no physical intimacy is allowed.

197
00:13:28.475 --> 00:13:29.309
Second point

198
00:13:30.936 --> 00:13:34.439
There are only five scenes with Quoncena per episode.

199
00:13:34.523 --> 00:13:36.358
Do not go beyond that.

200
00:13:36.942 --> 00:13:37.776
Third point

201
00:13:37.859 --> 00:13:39.194
Team two will begin filming.

202
00:13:39.277 --> 00:13:43.198
And I will shoot with the second team of directors.
Not with director Park Pyung Ki.

203
00:13:43.698 --> 00:13:44.533
Fourth point

204
00:13:44.616 --> 00:13:48.703
After the end of this season Im Hyun Joon will not play Kang Pil Goo again.

205
00:13:51.248 --> 00:13:52.207
Please feel free to drink.

206
00:13:52.791 --> 00:13:54.501
You've been wanting to try this for a long time.

207
00:14:01.424 --> 00:14:03.051
These are my conditions.

208
00:14:03.134 --> 00:14:05.011
If you accept these conditions

209
00:14:05.720 --> 00:14:07.973
- He said he would play.
- What if you don't accept it?

210
00:14:08.056 --> 00:14:10.225
If you don't accept He won't play.

211
00:14:10.308 --> 00:14:12.978
For now we accept it.
Can you then change your mind later?

212
00:14:13.061 --> 00:14:14.604
- It's true!
- Right?

213
00:14:14.688 --> 00:14:16.314
If you change your mind He won't play.

214
00:14:18.358 --> 00:14:19.526
Do they accept the terms?

215
00:14:19.609 --> 00:14:20.652
All of the above?

216
00:14:22.362 --> 00:14:23.196
What do you say about Pyeonggi?

217
00:14:23.280 --> 00:14:26.157
Writer Park... now must be called Director Park.

218
00:14:26.241 --> 00:14:28.201
Anyway, he accepted everything.

219
00:14:28.285 --> 00:14:30.787
You know that he's not a two-faced person.

220
00:14:30.870 --> 00:14:32.664
I think we can trust him.

221
00:14:32.747 --> 00:14:33.957
That kid has changed a lot.

222
00:14:34.040 --> 00:14:37.586
Not a fan of making indie films
The same person anymore

223
00:14:37.669 --> 00:14:39.629
Now that kid is taking private Pilates lessons.

224
00:14:39.713 --> 00:14:42.799
and sip 20,000 won coffee while eating brunch

225
00:14:42.882 --> 00:14:45.176
It's not the same Park Pyung Ki as before.

226
00:14:45.260 --> 00:14:47.971
I have a supercar worth hundreds of millions of won.

227
00:14:48.054 --> 00:14:49.973
both using their power to persecute the director and production company

228
00:14:50.056 --> 00:14:53.435
And I ate chicken breast salad instead of just fried chicken.

229
00:14:53.977 --> 00:14:55.687
Do you think I'm still the same?

230
00:14:55.770 --> 00:14:57.606
Okay, whatever.

231
00:14:57.689 --> 00:15:02.319
Well, as for the blind date without famous stars or reporters…

232
00:15:02.402 --> 00:15:06.323
I know a person who has a really great profile.
Do you want me to make an appointment?

233
00:15:06.406 --> 00:15:07.407
Blind date?

234
00:15:08.283 --> 00:15:11.494
Okay, after finishing this story, maybe.

235
00:15:11.578 --> 00:15:13.038
{\an8}Oh, I just begged you.

236
00:15:13.121 --> 00:15:15.040
Anyway, I'll see you at the baseball field.

237
00:15:15.123 --> 00:15:16.958
Hey, wait a minute.

238
00:15:17.042 --> 00:15:20.795
They probably sent sports reporters.
Coming to the kickoff event, right?

239
00:15:20.879 --> 00:15:23.590
{\an8}Hey man, I have a call.

240
00:15:23.673 --> 00:15:25.300
{\an8}See you soon!

241
00:15:38.480 --> 00:15:39.314
Are you going on a blind date?

242
00:15:39.397 --> 00:15:41.024
Damn, I'm totally shocked.

243
00:15:42.984 --> 00:15:44.069
Oh, go on a blind date.

244
00:15:44.152 --> 00:15:46.071
I really like that reporter.

245
00:15:46.613 --> 00:15:49.908
If you like her that much Go and date her yourself.

246
00:15:49.991 --> 00:15:51.910
Have you seen her before?

247
00:15:51.993 --> 00:15:53.662
I met her when I went to Hong Shin's house.

248
00:15:53.745 --> 00:15:56.206
She seems really cool and really passionate about the work she does.

249
00:15:57.332 --> 00:15:58.625
Are you still dating that kid?

250
00:15:58.708 --> 00:16:01.127
I've grown this big already.
Do you still have to ask permission when making friends?

251
00:16:04.547 --> 00:16:05.465
Here you are.

252
00:16:05.965 --> 00:16:07.801
I say this because I'm worried about you.

253
00:16:07.884 --> 00:16:09.594
But I have to meet someone.

254
00:16:09.678 --> 00:16:11.971
who really likes who you are
It's not because I'm an actor.

255
00:16:15.850 --> 00:16:18.520
Yes, I'll find someone like that.
Since I like to make decisions like this

256
00:16:21.147 --> 00:16:24.067
