I meet neighbors who greet each other regularly.

518
00:32:39.833 --> 00:32:42.670
They say things that bother me.

519
00:32:42.753 --> 00:32:46.173
And as soon as I heard it, I suddenly couldn't breathe.

520
00:32:46.256 --> 00:32:48.425
I knew I was having another panic attack.

521
00:32:52.554 --> 00:32:53.514
Yes, that is...

522
00:32:54.848 --> 00:32:56.141
Should I tell you more quickly?

523
00:32:57.184 --> 00:32:59.561
There is no one in the waiting room today. You can continue the story.

524
00:32:59.645 --> 00:33:00.604
This is it.

525
00:33:02.439 --> 00:33:04.024
I'm very curious about this.

526
00:33:04.108 --> 00:33:06.235
How can I have panic disorder?

527
00:33:06.318 --> 00:33:07.986
I really don't understand at all.

528
00:33:08.070 --> 00:33:08.987
In what sense?

529
00:33:10.656 --> 00:33:13.992
I once had my career ruined because of a woman.

530
00:33:14.076 --> 00:33:15.577
My mother has financial problems.

531
00:33:15.661 --> 00:33:18.038
And I have to earn money for my younger brother's tuition.

532
00:33:18.122 --> 00:33:20.708
Even if I stay up all night sewing books in the printing shop.

533
00:33:20.791 --> 00:33:22.209
I'm perfectly fine.

534
00:33:22.292 --> 00:33:24.378
My life is much better now than it was then.

535
00:33:24.461 --> 00:33:28.132
I can have or do whatever I want.
And I have a life that everyone envies.

536
00:33:28.215 --> 00:33:30.759
So how did I get a panic attack because of a trivial matter?

537
00:33:30.843 --> 00:33:32.428
If people like me could have panic attacks

538
00:33:32.511 --> 00:33:35.681
So nine out of ten people in this country
Won't I get this disease too?

539
00:33:35.764 --> 00:33:39.059
It's normal to have panic attacks.
After returning from the battlefield

540
00:33:39.143 --> 00:33:40.936
More than if it happened while on the battlefield.

541
00:33:43.439 --> 00:33:46.358
So what should I do to get better?

542
00:33:46.442 --> 00:33:48.026
Besides taking medicine

543
00:33:48.110 --> 00:33:49.528
Get enough sleep and eat well.

544
00:33:49.611 --> 00:33:52.698
And avoid drinking alcohol with coffee for now.

545
00:33:52.781 --> 00:33:54.241
And if it's a matter of mental health

546
00:33:54.324 --> 00:33:57.035
Having a positive relationship helps.

547
00:33:58.370 --> 00:33:59.329
So…

548
00:34:01.707 --> 00:34:03.542
Is it possible?

549
00:34:04.376 --> 00:34:06.003
The doctor thought that having a boyfriend...

550
00:34:07.629 --> 00:34:08.839
Can you help me?

551
00:34:11.341 --> 00:34:13.635
Of course, meeting the right person will definitely help.

552
00:34:13.719 --> 00:34:16.972
But don't expect the panic symptoms to improve.
Just because someone cares and takes care of you.

553
00:34:17.055 --> 00:34:19.475
Reciprocal love is better.

554
00:34:19.558 --> 00:34:22.352
It's like having shortness of breath. If you think about it carefully

555
00:34:22.436 --> 00:34:26.023
People think of shortness of breath.
It will help relieve the symptoms of shortness of breath.

556
00:34:26.106 --> 00:34:28.567
It's the same.
People think of building a rapport with someone.

557
00:34:28.650 --> 00:34:32.488
And feeling loved and cared for will make things better.

558
00:34:32.571 --> 00:34:33.989
But it's not true.

559
00:34:34.656 --> 00:34:35.824
Breathe in

560
00:34:37.451 --> 00:34:38.619
and exhale

561
00:34:40.579 --> 00:34:42.289
Like we breathe in and out

562
00:34:42.372 --> 00:34:45.626
Love must be both given and received.

563
00:34:55.344 --> 00:34:56.512
Hello

564
00:34:56.595 --> 00:34:59.723
Hello, nice to meet you.

565
00:34:59.807 --> 00:35:00.974
Nice to meet you too.

566
00:35:01.892 --> 00:35:04.186
Mr. Hyun Jun, what is your MBTI?

567
00:35:05.813 --> 00:35:07.314
My MBTI?

568
00:35:07.981 --> 00:35:10.609
I am an INFJ...

569
00:35:10.692 --> 00:35:12.569
Not true, you are an INTP.

570
00:35:13.570 --> 00:35:14.404
So?

571
00:35:15.405 --> 00:35:16.532
You know better than me.

572
00:35:16.615 --> 00:35:20.661
You are normally a very enthusiastic person.
and cannot tolerate injustice

573
00:35:20.744 --> 00:35:24.081
So I thought you were an extrovert.
But you're the complete opposite.

574
00:35:24.164 --> 00:35:25.624
This is it.

575
00:35:26.124 --> 00:35:30.420
It's because of Kang Pilgu.
It's just the character I play.

576
00:35:31.004 --> 00:35:32.256
Where are you staying, Mr. Hyun Jun?

577
00:35:32.339 --> 00:35:34.591
Oh, I'm here...

578
00:35:34.675 --> 00:35:37.594
I saw on the net that you were staying at Hunnam Dai.

579
00:35:38.178 --> 00:35:39.930
It's exorbitantly expensive there, isn't it?

580
00:35:42.516 --> 00:35:43.892
Is there that information on the internet?

581
00:35:43.976 --> 00:35:45.561
I have it.

582
00:35:46.812 --> 00:35:49.189
Have you ever met Byun Woo Seok?
And what about Cha Eunwoo?

583
00:35:49.273 --> 00:35:51.191
I bet they're really handsome in real life.

584
00:35:52.276 --> 00:35:54.361
Yes, definitely.

585
00:35:54.987 --> 00:35:55.821
Yes.

586
00:35:55.904 --> 00:35:57.990
Is it really Mr. Im Hyun Jun?

587
00:35:58.574 --> 00:36:00.826
I'm a big fan!

588
00:36:00.909 --> 00:36:03.829
I've watched every season of "Kang Pilgu."

589
00:36:03.912 --> 00:36:04.997
- Thank you…
- Clink!

590
00:36:05.080 --> 00:36:06.498
"They say you can't fix other people."

591
00:36:06.582 --> 00:36:07.708
"But I can do it."

592
00:36:07.791 --> 00:36:08.917
Great sentence, right?

593
00:36:09.793 --> 00:36:10.752
Yes, that's right.

594
00:36:12.880 --> 00:36:15.299
Damn, I feel like I should sign your autograph.

595
00:36:15.382 --> 00:36:17.342
That's good. I want to take pictures too.

596
00:36:17.426 --> 00:36:19.803
Can I post on social media?
Thank you.

597
00:36:19.887 --> 00:36:21.096
Wait, I...

598
00:36:21.179 --> 00:36:22.097
Smile!

599
00:36:31.315 --> 00:36:33.275
Mr. Hyun Jun, did you return home safely?

600
00:36:33.358 --> 00:36:37.070
I am very pleased and honored to meet you today.

601
00:36:39.072 --> 00:36:40.657
What kind of honor is this?

602
00:36:43.452 --> 00:36:44.703
Have you gone home yet?

603
00:36:47.122 --> 00:36:50.542
Hey, how do kids these days find people to date?

604
00:36:50.626 --> 00:36:51.627
Why do you ask?

605
00:36:52.961 --> 00:36:55.505
My friends use dating apps.

606
00:36:57.132 --> 00:36:58.216
A dating app?

607
00:36:59.885 --> 00:37:01.053
The world has come to an end.

608
00:37:01.136 --> 00:37:04.306
Soon AI will rule the world.

609
00:37:04.389 --> 00:37:06.391
Look, I'm talking. Suzy is my best friend.

610
00:37:06.475 --> 00:37:09.519
and people used to know each other as pen pals
Then they got married.

611
00:37:09.603 --> 00:37:12.105
Study hard. Instead of teaching me, you bastard.

612
00:37:12.940 --> 00:37:13.774
Really crazy

613
00:37:15.317 --> 00:37:17.736
But what's in those boxes?

614
00:37:19.446 --> 00:37:21.406
The rice cooker I advertised for you.

615
00:37:21.490 --> 00:37:23.951
The advertising company sent it as a gift.
But I don't know who to give it to.

616
00:37:24.910 --> 00:37:26.244
It looks expensive.

617
00:37:26.828 --> 00:37:28.080
Can I sell it on the Onion app?

618
00:37:29.122 --> 00:37:30.123
Onion apples?

619
00:37:30.916 --> 00:37:32.417
Oh, a platform for selling second-hand goods?

620
00:37:33.251 --> 00:37:35.128
- If you want to do something, just do it.
- Cool.

621
00:37:37.255 --> 00:37:38.090
Oh, that's true.

622
00:37:38.173 --> 00:37:40.968
- My account has been suspended.
- Why?

623
00:37:41.051 --> 00:37:43.595
I sell down jackets.
I got a little as a gift.

624
00:37:43.679 --> 00:37:45.555
And someone reported me as a commercial seller.

625
00:37:46.556 --> 00:37:48.642
Oh my gosh.

626
00:37:49.142 --> 00:37:50.227
I'd like to borrow your mobile phone, please.

627
00:37:52.688 --> 00:37:55.273
Hey, how do you know my password?

628
00:37:56.358 --> 00:37:57.567
What's my birthday?

629
00:38:02.114 --> 00:38:03.490
(Enter name: Kang Pilgu
This nickname is already used)

630
00:38:03.573 --> 00:38:04.866
Why are there so many people named Kang Pilgu?

631
00:38:04.950 --> 00:38:06.201
What are you doing?

632
00:38:06.284 --> 00:38:09.204
I downloaded the Onion app.
But there are too many people using the name Kang Pilgu.

633
00:38:09.287 --> 00:38:10.247
I can't take it like this.

634
00:38:12.541 --> 00:38:16.128
How much of my stuff are you selling?
The account has been suspended.

635
00:38:19.548 --> 00:38:20.382
Hoy!

636
00:38:20.882 --> 00:38:23.427
What are you doing with my cell phone?

637
00:38:31.309 --> 00:38:33.562
Of course, meeting the right person will definitely help.

638
00:38:38.525 --> 00:38:39.943
I have to meet someone.

639
00:38:40.027 --> 00:38:41.862
who really likes who you are
It's not because I'm an actor.

640
00:38:47.284 --> 00:38:48.243
Onions!

641
00:38:57.210 --> 00:38:58.670
What is this?

642
00:38:58.754 --> 00:39:01.798
Hello, do you still have any rice cookers left?

643
00:39:01.882 --> 00:39:03.508
already exists

644
00:39:04.134 --> 00:39:07.554
- There is.
- Can you lower the price to 30,000 won?

645
00:39:08.305 --> 00:39:09.347
Thirty thousand won?

646
00:39:10.807 --> 00:39:13.435
Come on, whatever you want to do, do it.

647
00:39:13.518 --> 00:39:14.728
Yes, you can reduce it.

648
00:39:16.855 --> 00:39:20.150
That bastard named me that. "Godfather of Drama"

649
00:39:20.233 --> 00:39:21.068
(The spirit is here, the godfather of drama)

650
00:39:26.948 --> 00:39:28.158
The godfather of drama...

651
00:39:28.658 --> 00:39:31.953
Ask for a vegetable sandwich with parmesan cheese on oregano bread.

652
00:39:32.037 --> 00:39:35.040
Add lettuce and tomatoes
Cucumber, bell pepper and onion

653
00:39:35.123 --> 00:39:37.876
As for the sauce... can you give me some recommendations?

654
00:39:37.959 --> 00:39:39.211
- Yes.
- Thank you.

655
00:39:45.801 --> 00:39:48.261
Oh, I ordered as you suggested. Absolutely delicious!

656
00:39:48.345 --> 00:39:51.014
You see, I always order it when I'm dieting.

657
00:39:52.265 --> 00:39:55.102
But how about the blind date?

658
00:39:55.811 --> 00:39:57.354
It's good, maybe.

659
00:39:57.437 --> 00:39:59.272
What's going on? You don't like anyone at all?

660
00:40:00.148 --> 00:40:02.526
No, it just feels like…

661
00:40:03.318 --> 00:40:05.737
I organize more one-on-one fan meetings.

662
00:40:06.822 --> 00:40:08.323
It's all your fault!

663
00:40:08.406 --> 00:40:11.535
I have to do a rom-com or a soap opera.
If I want to have a boyfriend!

664
00:40:12.744 --> 00:40:15.122
Why do you always blame me for everything?

665
00:40:15.664 --> 00:40:17.082
Really asking?

666
00:40:17.165 --> 00:40:19.334
News about you playing Kang Pilgu will be published today.

667
00:40:19.417 --> 00:40:21.837
- Is that okay?
- Yeah.

668
00:40:21.920 --> 00:40:23.964
I'm going to meet Sports Chief Eun Sung.
With reporter Wi Jung Shin

669
00:40:24.047 --> 00:40:24.965
Shall we go together?

670
00:40:25.549 --> 00:40:26.800
Do I have to go too?

671
00:40:26.883 --> 00:40:29.052
Well, you're busy shooting commercials, right?

672
00:40:30.220 --> 00:40:33.932
You think I'm a kid there?

673
00:40:34.516 --> 00:40:35.433
Actually, not really.

674
00:40:37.435 --> 00:40:38.812
I can find the time

675
00:40:38.895 --> 00:40:40.397
Then it's ok.

676
00:40:59.332 --> 00:41:00.542
- Hello.
- It's me.

677
00:41:01.376 --> 00:41:02.335
Thank you.

678
00:41:03.170 --> 00:41:04.379
Don't thank me.

679
00:41:06.214 --> 00:41:08.758
I didn't play because she had feelings for me.

680
00:41:09.718 --> 00:41:12.804
I just don't want to lower myself to your level.

681
00:41:13.722 --> 00:41:14.890
So don't misunderstand.

682
00:41:18.476 --> 00:41:19.895
- Are you listening?
- I'm listening.

683
00:41:20.604 --> 00:41:22.022
I've heard everything you said.

684
00:41:22.105 --> 00:41:23.481
I'll call you again.

685
00:41:30.614 --> 00:41:31.823
Oh, what?

686
00:41:33.325 --> 00:41:34.910
- The director wants to explain.
- What do you say?

687
00:41:34.993 --> 00:41:36.578
The concept of today's filming.

688
00:41:36.661 --> 00:41:38.038
- He's waiting outside.
- Oh, okay.

689
00:41:38.121 --> 00:41:39.497
- Tell him to come in.
- Yes.

690
00:41:39.581 --> 00:41:41.750
But he said the concept has changed.

691
00:41:41.833 --> 00:41:44.127
- Oh, all right.
- Is that okay?

692
00:41:44.211 --> 00:41:46.046
- Yes, tell him to come in.
- Yes.

693
00:41:46.129 --> 00:41:47.547
- This is Gil Soo.
- Yes.

694
00:41:47.631 --> 00:41:49.007
Today's filming will be finished before 6 p.m., right?

695
00:41:49.090 --> 00:41:51.384
- Yes, about that.
- That's good.

696
00:41:54.846 --> 00:41:55.680
Director

697
00:41:56.431 --> 00:41:58.183
Hello, actor!

698
00:41:58.266 --> 00:42:00.685
- Hello.
- It's an honor to work together again.

699
00:42:00.769 --> 00:42:03.021
No problem, I'm looking forward to it.

700
00:42:03.104 --> 00:42:05.065
Let me explain the filming concept first.

701
00:42:05.148 --> 00:42:07.651
- Has there been a change?
- A little bit.

702
00:42:07.734 --> 00:42:10.195
- I understand.
- If you look here, this is a ballet costume…

703
00:42:10.278 --> 00:42:11.696
Wait a minute.

704
00:42:13.365 --> 00:42:15.742
I shouldn't eat because I'm on a diet.

705
00:42:15.825 --> 00:42:17.577
If it's delicious, it's zero calories!

706
00:42:18.411 --> 00:42:19.537
Why is it so salty?

707
00:42:19.621 --> 00:42:22.290
You can eat this and you can eat the horseradish.

708
00:42:22.374 --> 00:42:23.291
Father

709
00:42:23.375 --> 00:42:25.961
The soup of Ramyun is divine.
Both low calorie and mellow taste

710
00:42:26.044 --> 00:42:27.963
Dad won't be a fan of the big guys!

711
00:42:28.046 --> 00:42:30.715
Oh, I'm hungry.

712
00:42:31.508 --> 00:42:34.094
But I might regret eating ramen.

713
00:42:34.678 --> 00:42:37.681
Mr. Detective, if you don't eat now
You'll regret it until tomorrow.

714
00:42:37.764 --> 00:42:38.848
(God's Ramyun
mellow taste)

715
00:42:41.559 --> 00:42:44.396
Worried that it's already late?
Or are you worried that it's past midnight?

716
00:42:44.479 --> 00:42:47.524
Don't worry.
A divine ramyun as desired

717
00:42:47.607 --> 00:42:50.735
Eat deliciously, don't worry.

718
00:42:50.819 --> 00:42:53.405
Awesome Ramyun with great taste.

719
00:42:53.488 --> 00:42:55.448
Come eat delicious Ramyeon.

720
00:42:55.532 --> 00:42:56.658
Divine level!

721
00:42:56.741 --> 00:42:57.867
I'm not playing!

722
00:42:57.951 --> 00:42:59.744
Having to wear a ramen packet is bad enough!

723
00:42:59.828 --> 00:43:02.038
Why does it always have to end at Kang Pilgu?

724
00:43:02.122 --> 00:43:05.625
Call CEO Hwang, dammit.
Told you I wouldn't shoot this commercial!

725
00:43:05.709 --> 00:43:07.252
Come on, please, they'll kill me.

726
00:43:07.335 --> 00:43:09.462
Don't look at me like that. I'm not playing.

727
00:43:10.046 --> 00:43:11.756
If it's delicious, it's zero calories.

728
00:43:12.382 --> 00:43:13.883
The best Ramyeon is…

729
00:43:14.467 --> 00:43:16.469
Cut! Try again.

730
00:43:26.730 --> 00:43:28.023
I'm sorry.

731
00:43:28.106 --> 00:43:30.358
Just then, an urgent matter came in. And the boss can't come.

732
00:43:30.442 --> 00:43:31.985
Oh, right?

733
00:43:32.068 --> 00:43:34.946
Mr. Im Hyun Jun is currently filming a Ramyeon commercial.

734
00:43:35.030 --> 00:43:37.991
Filming took longer than expected.
So he may not be able to come.

735
00:43:38.074 --> 00:43:39.117
I'm really sorry.

736
00:43:39.200 --> 00:43:40.076
It's okay.

737
00:43:40.160 --> 00:43:43.121
- Please come and order food.
- Thank you.

738
00:43:44.581 --> 00:43:46.541
Come eat delicious Ramyeon.

739
00:43:46.624 --> 00:43:47.959
Divine level!

740
00:43:48.043 --> 00:43:49.044
Cut!

741
00:43:49.127 --> 00:43:51.546
Everyone's strength is starting to spread out.

742
00:43:51.629 --> 00:43:52.547
Once again!

743
00:43:54.174 --> 00:43:55.050
ready

744
00:44:04.809 --> 00:44:06.728
The best Ramyeon has chewy noodles.

745
00:44:06.811 --> 00:44:09.606
And the soup is beyond delicious!

746
00:44:10.231 --> 00:44:11.066
Cut!

747
00:44:13.860 --> 00:44:15.195
Take a break, everyone!

748
00:44:28.708 --> 00:44:30.835
- Oppa, it's time to go back inside.
- Okay.

749
00:44:31.920 --> 00:44:33.254
What time is it, Gilsoo?

750
00:44:33.755 --> 00:44:34.589
It's already six o'clock.

751
00:44:36.466 --> 00:44:37.717
- It's already six o'clock?
- Yes.

752
00:44:37.801 --> 00:44:39.344
Better hurry and finish taking pictures.

753
00:44:42.722 --> 00:44:43.723
Come on!

754
00:44:43.807 --> 00:44:45.892
- fight!
- Let's go.

755
00:44:47.143 --> 00:44:50.647
Mr. Detective, if you don't eat now
You'll regret it until tomorrow.

756
00:44:50.730 --> 00:44:54.651
The best Ramyeon has chewy noodles.
And the soup is beyond delicious!

757
00:44:54.734 --> 00:44:57.904
Cut! Great, it's done!

758
00:45:01.157 --> 00:45:02.075
Well done!

759
00:45:02.700 --> 00:45:03.910
Here, please take it off.

760
00:45:03.993 --> 00:45:05.245
Hurry!

761
00:45:07.705 --> 00:45:08.957
- Gil Soo
- Yes.

762
00:45:09.040 --> 00:45:10.208
How far is it?

763
00:45:10.291 --> 00:45:12.043
It's almost there.

764
00:45:12.127 --> 00:45:14.254
Okay, hurry up, understand?

765
00:45:15.171 --> 00:45:16.214
How much longer?

766
00:45:16.297 --> 00:45:19.050
not very long
But the estimated time keeps increasing.

767
00:45:19.134 --> 00:45:20.009
Let's hurry up, okay?

768
00:45:20.093 --> 00:45:22.178
- I'll go as quickly as possible.
- Okay, hurry up.

769
00:45:30.145 --> 00:45:32.063
You can go back!

770
00:45:32.147 --> 00:45:34.315
Wait, not that way! It's here.

771
00:45:36.860 --> 00:45:37.694
Okay, you can go home!

772
00:45:38.528 --> 00:45:39.654
What's wrong with him?

773
00:45:44.117 --> 00:45:47.704
Reporter Wi Jung Shin The reason I want to meet you...

774
00:45:48.538 --> 00:45:50.540
Oh, I'm here.

775
00:45:50.623 --> 00:45:52.625
What, have you finished filming?

776
00:45:52.709 --> 00:45:54.752
- Why did you...
- Hey, brother.

777
00:45:54.836 --> 00:45:58.756
Come quickly, take a seat.

778
00:45:58.840 --> 00:46:00.967
- But you...
- Hurry, brother.

779
00:46:01.050 --> 00:46:03.094
- How did you come here?
- Well...

780
00:46:03.178 --> 00:46:04.762
I thought the filming was finished late.

781
00:46:06.389 --> 00:46:07.432
Well...

782
00:46:07.515 --> 00:46:10.518
Filming finished quickly because it came out really well.

783
00:46:10.602 --> 00:46:11.978
Oh, this is it.

784
00:46:12.562 --> 00:46:14.272
That's it, little one.

785
00:46:14.355 --> 00:46:16.524
- There wasn't any traffic jams on the way here, right?
- Not at all.

786
00:46:16.608 --> 00:46:18.151
Oh, I understand.

787
00:46:21.613 --> 00:46:22.489
We haven't seen each other for a long time.

788
00:46:22.572 --> 00:46:23.907
Yes, hello.

789
00:46:25.033 --> 00:46:26.534
I thought you couldn't come.

790
00:46:26.618 --> 00:46:28.411
No, I'm here.

791
00:46:30.079 --> 00:46:31.289
When it's about me

792
00:46:31.372 --> 00:46:34.584
So I'm here to tell you.

793
00:46:40.673 --> 00:46:42.634
- Did you tell her already?
- What did you say?

794
00:46:42.717 --> 00:46:44.761
- What's my news?
- Not yet. I haven't told you yet.

795
00:46:44.844 --> 00:46:47.096
- Come on, tell her.
- Okay.

796
00:46:48.056 --> 00:46:49.390
Ah, someone called.

797
00:46:49.474 --> 00:46:51.142
- I have to answer this call.
- Okay.

798
00:47:06.074 --> 00:47:07.200
How are you?

799
00:47:08.409 --> 00:47:09.619
I'm fine.

800
00:47:10.411 --> 00:47:11.329
Yes.

801
00:47:12.580 --> 00:47:14.624
- And are you well?
- Good.

802
00:47:15.124 --> 00:47:16.501
Of course I'm fine.

803
00:47:18.628 --> 00:47:21.422
Reporter V Jung Shin, I'm really sorry.

804
00:47:21.506 --> 00:47:23.049
There's an urgent matter. I have to go back first.

805
00:47:23.132 --> 00:47:24.884
Keywords for news…

806
00:47:24.968 --> 00:47:26.553
Oh, yes, little one, tell her.

807
00:47:26.636 --> 00:47:27.929
- Me?
- Oh, that's right.

808
00:47:28.012 --> 00:47:30.056
Let's meet later.

809
00:47:30.139 --> 00:47:31.766
- Hey, but…
- See you!

810
00:47:35.478 --> 00:47:37.105
Oh, I said come on.

811
00:47:38.648 --> 00:47:41.526
Why are you in such a hurry?

812
00:47:42.193 --> 00:47:44.153
Let's eat something before we talk.

813
00:47:46.364 --> 00:47:48.199
But I ate all the desserts.

814
00:47:53.162 --> 00:47:54.872
But I haven't eaten anything yet.

815
00:47:55.373 --> 00:48:00.336
Last order of food is at 8:00 p.m.
The kitchen is closed.

816
00:48:00.420 --> 00:48:02.088
ขอโทษด้วยจริงๆ ค่ะ คุณลูกค้า

817
00:48:03.756 --> 00:48:05.466
Do you know any restaurants around here?

818
00:48:08.803 --> 00:48:10.722
My manager drives me everywhere.

819
00:48:11.806 --> 00:48:15.810
And lately I've been watching my diet.
So I don't know any good restaurants.

820
00:48:16.811 --> 00:48:17.854
I know where we can go.

821
00:48:18.521 --> 00:48:19.355
At…

822
00:48:21.190 --> 00:48:22.609
It's dark

823
00:48:23.026 --> 00:48:24.444
and private

824
00:48:28.615 --> 00:48:29.574
Karma

825
00:48:30.199 --> 00:48:34.329
There are only teenagers who come to eat ramen.
and make memories here

826
00:48:34.412 --> 00:48:36.623
I can't believe I would do this at my age.

827
00:48:37.206 --> 00:48:38.875
Will it be okay? If someone takes a photo

828
00:48:39.459 --> 00:48:41.377
We came to find something to eat, just the two of us at this time.

829
00:48:44.756 --> 00:48:47.091
At least you bought the ramyun I promoted.

830
00:48:50.428 --> 00:48:53.222
You've never seen "Kang Pilgu."
or show interest in me

831
00:48:53.306 --> 00:48:54.974
So how do you know you have to buy this brand?

832
00:48:55.975 --> 00:48:56.809
Coincidentally.

833
00:49:00.355 --> 00:49:04.025
Well, tell me.
What is the news you want to give?

834
00:49:07.904 --> 00:49:11.574
It's been confirmed that there will be a fifth season of "Kang Pilgu."

835
00:49:12.075 --> 00:49:14.827
And Quonzena will also be performing.

836
00:49:16.663 --> 00:49:19.666
I think it's good for dramas that have world-class stars playing them.

837
00:49:19.749 --> 00:49:22.877
But the main character has always been Kang Pil Goo.
and always will be

838
00:49:22.960 --> 00:49:24.921
I don't want fans Worried that her character

839
00:49:25.004 --> 00:49:26.631
will steal the light from my character

840
00:49:27.632 --> 00:49:29.425
Could you please put this information in the news?

841
00:49:33.262 --> 00:49:34.806
I'll start writing news.

842
00:50:26.858 --> 00:50:28.109
- What?
- What?

843
00:50:29.235 --> 00:50:30.278
Do you have something to say?

844
00:50:30.987 --> 00:50:31.821
No.

845
00:50:35.032 --> 00:50:35.992
That is...

846
00:50:36.993 --> 00:50:38.202
I'm thirsty.

847
00:50:38.703 --> 00:50:39.746
So what?

848
00:50:44.625 --> 00:50:45.710
Do you have water?

849
00:50:48.838 --> 00:50:49.756
There aren't any.

850
00:50:55.052 --> 00:50:55.887
Are your feet okay?

851
00:50:58.014 --> 00:51:00.933
Your foot hurts from kicking the window to help me.

852
00:51:01.017 --> 00:51:03.227
Wait, do you remember that too?

853
00:51:04.854 --> 00:51:05.688
I remember it roughly.

854
00:51:07.106 --> 00:51:09.150
It's been gone for a long time.

855
00:51:09.984 --> 00:51:11.110
It's nothing anymore.

856
00:51:16.699 --> 00:51:17.658
That is...

857
00:51:20.286 --> 00:51:21.204
I have…

858
00:51:22.705 --> 00:51:24.165
The story will be told.

859
00:51:31.756 --> 00:51:32.799
I'm sorry about that.

860
00:51:36.344 --> 00:51:38.054
who assumes that you work as a student

861
00:51:40.097 --> 00:51:41.182
I'm sorry.

862
00:51:54.028 --> 00:51:55.822
Hey, please say something.

863
00:51:55.905 --> 00:51:59.700
I sincerely apologize
And now I'm really embarrassed.

864
00:51:59.784 --> 00:52:02.495
Do I have to accept your apology?

865
00:52:04.038 --> 00:52:04.997
What do you say?

866
00:52:05.081 --> 00:52:06.082
It's like...

867
00:52:07.166 --> 00:52:09.335
It is normal to accept an apology.

868
00:52:09.418 --> 00:52:11.170
When the other party feels guilty

869
00:52:11.254 --> 00:52:14.173
I haven't done anything that is unforgivable.
It's just a misunderstanding.

870
00:52:14.966 --> 00:52:17.635
It's okay to apologize when you make a mistake.

871
00:52:18.219 --> 00:52:19.971
But accepting an apology is up to the other person.

872
00:52:20.763 --> 00:52:21.848
Incredible

873
00:52:21.931 --> 00:52:24.892
I forgive you for breaking into the bathroom.

874
00:52:24.976 --> 00:52:27.812
and embarrassed me while I was running errands

875
00:52:27.895 --> 00:52:30.648
I even forgave you for stalking me.
Go into the hospital room.

876
00:52:30.731 --> 00:52:32.316
and for you to write a special scoop

877
00:52:32.400 --> 00:52:34.902
And I won't take issue with you.
for writing news to my mother like that

878
00:52:34.986 --> 00:52:36.404
Do you know anything?

879
00:52:36.487 --> 00:52:40.199
After saying everything clearly
I look like a boss!

880
00:52:40.700 --> 00:52:41.701
What do you say?

881
00:52:42.743 --> 00:52:44.537
You really won't accept my apology, will you?

882
00:52:45.538 --> 00:52:47.456
Until I give you a special scoop.

883
00:52:47.540 --> 00:52:49.208
and express how sorry I am

884
00:52:49.292 --> 00:52:50.167
Yes.

885
00:52:51.961 --> 00:52:53.129
I don't want an apology from you.

886
00:53:07.018 --> 00:53:08.352
Seriously?

887
00:53:12.565 --> 00:53:15.067
Stop staring at me and keep your eyes on the road!

888
00:53:15.151 --> 00:53:17.403
I have the right to stare at you!

889
00:53:19.113 --> 00:53:20.573
I forgot that today is my wife's birthday.

890
00:53:20.656 --> 00:53:23.993
And finally she forgave me.
After begging for an hour

891
00:53:24.076 --> 00:53:25.661
But you called me out again!

892
00:53:25.745 --> 00:53:28.122
Gil Soo can't accept him because he's been drinking!

893
00:53:28.205 --> 00:53:30.750
You should have called the driver instead of the CEO!

894
00:53:30.833 --> 00:53:32.376
Or just drive yourself!

895
00:53:32.460 --> 00:53:34.962
I'm calling you because I'm burning with anger!

896
00:53:35.880 --> 00:53:36.881
Damn it.

897
00:53:39.175 --> 00:53:41.427
What else this time?
Arguing with the reporter again?

898
00:53:41.510 --> 00:53:43.304
Who said we were fighting?

899
00:53:43.387 --> 00:53:46.223
I already apologized for thinking you were working as a leaning girl.

900
00:53:46.307 --> 00:53:48.142
But she doesn't accept the apology.

901
00:53:48.225 --> 00:53:51.270
I bet you're being arrogant and cocky.
and apologize in kind

902
00:53:51.354 --> 00:53:55.107
That's not true. I'm sincerely sorry.
For the first time in a long time

903
00:53:56.984 --> 00:53:58.152
onion!

904
00:53:58.736 --> 00:53:59.695
What?

905
00:54:00.863 --> 00:54:02.239
Do you play the Onion app?

906
00:54:03.032 --> 00:54:05.159
I posted things for sale to Sunwoo, that's all.

907
00:54:05.242 --> 00:54:08.037
Seriously, what did I do...

908
00:54:23.344 --> 00:54:24.387
Go take a shower and go to bed.

909
00:54:24.470 --> 00:54:25.805
How will you get home?

910
00:54:26.514 --> 00:54:29.266
I have to take a taxi.
Do you think I'm going to rent a scooter?

911
00:54:31.227 --> 00:54:32.061
Here it is.

912
00:54:33.020 --> 00:54:33.854
What?

913
00:54:34.438 --> 00:54:37.149
- Birthday present for your wife
- What do you say?

914
00:54:39.110 --> 00:54:40.569
- What is this?
- Press the button.

915
00:54:49.745 --> 00:54:52.581
Consider it a bribe not to let her divorce you because of me.

916
00:54:53.791 --> 00:54:55.876
Oh, brother!

917
00:54:55.960 --> 00:54:59.130
- Thank you very much, brother!
- Damn it, get out of here.

918
00:54:59.213 --> 00:55:00.840
Oh my gosh, take a look.

919
00:55:02.049 --> 00:55:04.969
Awesome, luxurious car!

920
00:55:05.052 --> 00:55:07.513
Finally had the merit of driving with him!

921
00:55:11.726 --> 00:55:12.893
Oh my gosh.

922
00:55:14.687 --> 00:55:15.771
Have you arrived home yet?

923
00:55:21.902 --> 00:55:22.987
Are you afraid?

924
00:55:25.656 --> 00:55:26.991
(Sandee Kang Pilgu 2)

925
00:55:27.074 --> 00:55:28.409
Really crazy

926
00:55:33.080 --> 00:55:34.749
Go change your clothes first.

927
00:55:34.832 --> 00:55:36.542
I think I've caught a cold.

928
00:55:36.625 --> 00:55:37.543
Do you have a cold?

929
00:55:39.253 --> 00:55:41.172
That's why I have to dress to keep my body warm.

930
00:55:42.673 --> 00:55:43.758
Drink some water.

931
00:55:44.508 --> 00:55:45.551
Yea

932
00:55:46.177 --> 00:55:48.220
Damn, there really are a lot of you.

933
00:55:52.600 --> 00:55:55.061
Take two pills of this before bed.

934
00:56:02.151 --> 00:56:03.235
I'm so bored.

935
00:56:03.319 --> 00:56:04.987
I heard that my Pilgu hyung went on a blind date.

936
00:56:05.654 --> 00:56:07.239
- Blind date?
- Yes.

937
00:56:07.323 --> 00:56:08.741
- With whom?
- How would you know?

938
00:56:08.824 --> 00:56:10.618
There must have been a long line of women waiting for him.

939
00:56:10.701 --> 00:56:12.244
Will you write this news as well?

940
00:56:13.996 --> 00:56:16.916
If I write it myself and create
My own work history It would be better

941
00:56:16.999 --> 00:56:18.793
Oh, this is really true.

942
00:56:19.376 --> 00:56:21.253
Don't you regret that you missed the opportunity with him?

943
00:56:21.337 --> 00:56:23.923
His face is good, he has a good figure, and his reputation is great.

944
00:56:24.507 --> 00:56:25.508
Listen.

945
00:56:26.383 --> 00:56:27.384
How do you feel?

946
00:56:28.344 --> 00:56:30.096
If you sincerely apologize to someone

947
00:56:31.597 --> 00:56:33.057
But the other party did not accept the apology.

948
00:56:35.559 --> 00:56:37.686
Did that person really do something bad?

949
00:56:39.980 --> 00:56:42.358
No, it's not that bad.

950
00:56:42.441 --> 00:56:44.777
Then I will cut ties with the other party.

951
00:56:48.739 --> 00:56:51.742
Are you the one apologizing? Or vice versa

952
00:56:52.743 --> 00:56:53.661
It's me

953
00:56:55.162 --> 00:56:56.455
I don't accept apologies.

954
00:56:56.539 --> 00:56:57.414
Why?

955
00:57:00.334 --> 00:57:01.836
Because when we accept an apology

956
00:57:03.045 --> 00:57:04.255
It makes us expect more.

957
00:57:06.841 --> 00:57:09.301
that they will treat us better than before

958
00:57:09.385 --> 00:57:11.262
Or will they be more friendly to us?

959
00:57:12.930 --> 00:57:15.015
No matter what, there's no way they can go together.

960
00:57:16.559 --> 00:57:18.686
So I thought it would be better to give up hope from the beginning.

961
00:57:22.439 --> 00:57:24.108
Do you know what that is called?

962
00:57:24.733 --> 00:57:25.568
How to build a wall?

963
00:57:26.610 --> 00:57:28.445
If you keep building walls like that

964
00:57:28.529 --> 00:57:30.698
I will be alone until I die.

965
00:57:30.781 --> 00:57:32.950
Hell, I don't take these pills.

966
00:57:40.124 --> 00:57:42.126
- This is Suzy.
- Yes.

967
00:57:43.377 --> 00:57:46.797
I've been in a bad mood since morning.

968
00:57:47.381 --> 00:57:48.257
So again?

969
00:57:50.426 --> 00:57:51.719
What do you mean "again"?

970
00:57:57.057 --> 00:58:00.853
Why don't people accept apologies?
Even though the other party has already apologized.

971
00:58:02.313 --> 00:58:04.481
I can't think of a good answer.

972
00:58:06.901 --> 00:58:08.444
I'm saying that.

973
00:58:08.527 --> 00:58:11.947
If I still don't know the answer
How would an AI assistant like you know that?

974
00:58:23.417 --> 00:58:24.710
(Sports Eun Sung
Wi Jungshin)

975
00:58:29.423 --> 00:58:31.300
Dammit, do I really have a cold?

976
00:58:34.511 --> 00:58:35.930
My throat hurts all over.

977
00:58:45.606 --> 00:58:46.857
("Confirmed production of the good detective Kang Pilgu Season 5")

978
00:58:46.941 --> 00:58:48.359
("International star Kwansena joins the cast")

979
00:58:51.111 --> 00:58:52.321
I don't want an apology from you.

980
00:58:54.114 --> 00:58:56.367
Hyung, I read the news about Kwansena joining you in a drama.

981
00:58:56.450 --> 00:58:57.618
Is it true?

982
00:58:58.202 --> 00:58:59.536
Yea

983
00:58:59.620 --> 00:59:02.248
You've read the news.

984
00:59:02.331 --> 00:59:05.084
I can't stand her one bit. Are you going to get back together?

985
00:59:05.668 --> 00:59:06.543
Are you crazy?

986
00:59:06.627 --> 00:59:08.712
I just keep my work and personal life separate.

987
00:59:10.631 --> 00:59:11.840
Where are you going?

988
00:59:12.508 --> 00:59:15.719
My friend's grandfather passed away. I'm going to the funeral.

989
00:59:17.137 --> 00:59:20.015
But today you're selling things from the Onion app!

990
00:59:20.099 --> 00:59:21.016
What a rice cooker!

991
00:59:21.100 --> 00:59:22.393
Really

992
00:59:22.476 --> 00:59:24.061
- It's almost time.
- That's bad.

993
00:59:24.144 --> 00:59:25.604
Can you go instead?

994
00:59:26.772 --> 00:59:28.607
I can't go out and sell rice cookers.

995
00:59:28.691 --> 00:59:30.276
Everyone knows my face.

996
00:59:30.359 --> 00:59:31.527
It's night now.

997
00:59:31.610 --> 00:59:32.945
Close your face and no one will recognize you.

998
00:59:33.028 --> 00:59:36.031
- No, absolutely not.
- My friend is waiting downstairs.

999
00:59:36.115 --> 00:59:37.574
Grab the pot and go, okay?

1000
00:59:37.658 --> 00:59:40.160
- No way! I cannot do!
- Come on, please help me!

1001
00:59:40.244 --> 00:59:41.412
Say no, hey!

1002
00:59:46.125 --> 00:59:49.503
(Sungil Station)

1003
00:59:58.512 --> 01:00:02.057
Why do you have to choose to meet in a place where there are a lot of people?

1004
01:00:03.267 --> 01:00:04.560
How do I know who it is?

1005
01:00:06.895 --> 01:00:08.564
(Smart Chef
Pressure rice cooker with heat conduction system

1006
01:00:09.148 --> 01:00:10.524
I'll find the buyer myself.

1007
01:00:16.697 --> 01:00:17.614
Onions!

1008
01:00:18.157 --> 01:00:19.533
(I'll be there in a minute.
I brought a cart with me.)

1009
01:00:23.787 --> 01:00:24.747
(I brought a cart with me.)

1010
01:00:29.877 --> 01:00:31.003
He's here.

1011
01:00:39.762 --> 01:00:41.305
Really crazy

1012
01:00:44.975 --> 01:00:46.643
It's from the onion apple, right?

1013
01:00:46.727 --> 01:00:47.728
What do you say?

1014
01:00:47.811 --> 01:00:49.897
Oh, that's right, onion apples.

1015
01:00:49.980 --> 01:00:51.440
- Is this it?
- Yes.

1016
01:00:58.364 --> 01:00:59.365
Ah…

1017
01:01:15.214 --> 01:01:17.299
I just paid you 320,000 won.
via onion pay

1018
01:01:17.925 --> 01:01:19.843
- What do you say?
- You don't use Onion Pay?

1019
01:01:20.344 --> 01:01:22.971
- Look in your app.
- Oh, I understand.

1020
01:01:23.055 --> 01:01:23.931
(Drama Godfather: received 320,000 won)

1021
01:01:24.515 --> 01:01:26.392
- Use it like this yourself.
- Here too.

1022
01:01:30.104 --> 01:01:31.355
I'm a fan of Im Hyun Jun.

1023
01:01:33.232 --> 01:01:34.608
Ah, thank you.

1024
01:01:34.691 --> 01:01:36.110
I have a whole box at my house.

1025
01:01:37.611 --> 01:01:38.570
Good night

1026
01:01:42.950 --> 01:01:43.992
I'm sorry.

1027
01:01:50.457 --> 01:01:51.333
คุณชอบ…

1028
01:01:52.793 --> 01:01:53.627
Is this Im Hyun Jun?

1029
01:01:54.211 --> 01:01:55.671
Yes, I like it.

1030
01:02:48.140 --> 01:02:49.850
This is the first time in my life.

1031
01:02:51.185 --> 01:02:52.644
I never liked anyone...

1032
01:02:54.062 --> 01:02:55.731
without prior conditions

1033
01:03:55.707 --> 01:03:57.417
{\an8}(Thank you Oh Yeon Seo
who came as a guest actor)

1034
01:04:00.337 --> 01:04:02.881
{\an8}- I am also a fan of Im Hyun Jun.
- Really asking.

1035
01:04:02.965 --> 01:04:04.883
{\an8}I love Kang Pilgu.

1036
01:04:04.967 --> 01:04:06.385
{\an8}Whoa, nice to meet you!

1037
01:04:07.094 --> 01:04:09.888
{\an8}How did you know about this place? I never told anyone!

1038
01:04:09.972 --> 01:04:11.765
{\an8}Just a moment!

1039
01:04:11.848 --> 01:04:13.016
{\an8}What's next?

1040
01:04:13.100 --> 01:04:15.519
{\an8}Destiny is not yet this great. Ours is the worst.

1041
01:04:15.602 --> 01:04:17.604
{\an8}I can share it with you. If you want

1042
01:04:17.688 --> 01:04:19.481
{\an8}You seem to be a bigger fan than I am.

1043
01:04:19.565 --> 01:04:22.693
{\an8}Actually, I look a lot like Im Hyun Joon.

1044
01:04:22.776 --> 01:04:24.403
{\an8}Just kidding.

1045
01:04:24.486 --> 01:04:25.529
{\an8}Want to come and see for yourself?

1046
01:04:25.612 --> 01:04:27.197
{\an8}How is this Friday?

1047
01:04:31.535 --> 01:04:33.537
{\an8}Narration by Chalanthon Ruangpakdee

